    {
      "id": 164854,
      "name": "Sunset Shadow",
      "username": "Sunset_Shadow",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/3d9bf3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-03-08T17:17:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Citizens Pain and Gain being dead actually seems rather clever to me. Most citizens have a \"____ and ____\" name scheme, and work well together. The one place that's been broken previously is with Citizens Truth&nbsp;<em>or&nbsp;</em>Dare, who won't peacefully coexist. In this case, however, the phrase is \"no pain, no gain.\" So it's fitting that neither of them would be living during the timeframe of the card game.</p>",
